# FOLIO doctrine

- Product job: honest share counts → refuse wash → buy on Solana → borrow without selling → guarded agent.
- Soft pitch only in user-facing copy; never lead with "corporate-action prime desk" jargon.
- Accra = build base, not beachhead ICP (EU/APAC non-US).
- Architecture docs + `memory/*` are binding. Update `memory/CURRENT_STATE.md`, `SESSION_LOG.md`, `FACT_CHECK.md` on material changes.
- Never claim unhackable / nation-state-proof. Document residual risk in `memory/THREAT_MODEL.md`.
- No mocks, no silent fallbacks, no fake xStock mints/fills. Missing dependency → fail-closed + labeled mode.
- Multi-tenant: httpOnly server sessions — no auth secrets in localStorage.
- Broadcast / mentor outreach paused while `BROADCAST_PAUSED=true` or Block 0 demo missing.
- Mainnet deploy of custom programs out of ≤~$1 budget — use mainnet READ + quote-only + local fork proofs.
- Secrets only in gitignored `.env` — never commit or re-echo keys from chat.